| 59
| [[File:059_found_soul.png|64px|link=]]
| Found Soul
| Found Soul is a familiar that follows Isaac's exact movements, akin to Jacob and Esau, and shoots spectral tears. It is spawned by the trinket Found Soul. The familiar uses Isaac's tears, range, shot speed, and tear effects, and deals 0.5x Isaac's damage. The familiar has collision and can be separated. Holding down the "drop" button keeps the familiar in place. When Isaac places a bomb, the familiar will drop one as well. The familiar can also press Buttons. The familiar dies after taking any damage, and will respawn on the next floor.
|-
